WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.350
<i>Episode 3</i>

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:51.190
Pan, pan, pan! The best pan ever!

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.670
A necessity for your daily life and travels!

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:57.100
Our pan can be used for 
cooking and self-defense!

00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:00.390
Why would you use a pan for self-defense?

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:02.890
Hello, friend. It looks like 
you're not from around here.

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:06.370
Recently, many thieves and robbers from 
other tribes have come to the capital.

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:08.020
You should buy our pan to defend yourself.

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:12.460
It's just a pan. Why advertise it
as an item for self-defense?

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:13.500
Who'd believe that?

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.640
Shopkeeper, I'll take your biggest one!

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:22.270
You're an idiot. It's a pan.
Stop acting like it's some kind of treasure.

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:26.270
You don't get it. I bought it because of fate.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:28.120
Lucky draw! Lucky draw!

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.140
New anti-theft items to win!

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:32.910
It only costs a dime for one draw!

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:35.020
A guaranteed super rare
item every ten draws!

00:02:35.810 --> 00:02:36.890
One draw, shopkeeper!

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:44.520
A <i>special</i> super rare item,
drawn on the first attempt!

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:47.270
Congratulations! You have won
our strongest anti-theft item!

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.520
What's in this box, shopkeeper?

00:02:49.760 --> 00:02:54.020
When you find yourself in danger, 
open it and you will find out.

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:01.250
Are you dense? You don't even know
what you've spent your money on.

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:03.890
You don't get it. I bought it on trust.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.140
Come and see our gray gamecock!

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:10.140
Product of the year:
a lightning-fast gray gamecock.

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:13.040
Never worry about
thieves and robbers again!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.910
This lightning-fast gray gamecock
will easily retrieve your items!

00:03:15.910 --> 00:03:17.640
Even if the thief has eight legs,

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:20.020
this gamecock will catch
them in three seconds flat!

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:24.890
What a load of hooey!
Even a ghost wouldn't believe that!

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:26.470
I want one, shopkeeper!

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:27.640
Stop it already!

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:32.140
I think you're being a fool.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:33.690
You do not get it.

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:37.140
If a woman wants something, she will find
thousands of reasons to justify buying it.

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:40.520
Something else worth buying?

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.770
Here comes the belle of Nan House!

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:54.410
Her face could launch a thousand ships!

00:03:54.410 --> 00:03:56.500
If I married her, it would be
the luckiest day of my life—

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:59.640
Go away, you boorish oafs!
Keep away from my mistress!

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.560
Xin'er, you should not speak like that.

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:06.270
Wow, she's so beautiful,
even I want to marry her!

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.410
So beautiful!

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:07.390
Hey, stop daydreaming! Snap out of it!

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:12.590
My lady!

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:16.120
Hey, you! Are you blind?
How dare you bump into my mistress!

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:18.910
Oh no, Xin'er... my purse is gone.

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:22.270
Hey! The man who bumped into my mistress!

00:04:24.190 --> 00:04:25.770
Stop!

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:32.200
My two beautiful ladies, allow me
to aid you in this simple matter.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:35.140
My lord... Are you moving house?

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:45.020
Refuel!

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.390
Here we go!

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:51.970
Lightning-fast...

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.390
...gray gamecock!

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:36.880
Don't stand there with your mouth open.
Take a look in your special super rare box.

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:38.020
Oh, right!

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:40.430
OPEN WHEN IN DANGER

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:46.390
Quick! Run!

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:46.600
Quick! Run!

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:47.270
Quick! Run!

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:48.640
Quick! Run!

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:54.000
Qian Aotian, that sly old fox...

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:58.560
How dare he disregard the safety of our
citizens by colluding with those people...

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:02.310
Is that why you married 
his favorite daughter?

00:06:02.310 --> 00:06:05.100
Father arranged our marriage.
She and I had no say in it.

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:10.060
However, it seems I have one 
more hostage in my hands now.

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:15.410
While you may say that, it must be painful 
for Brother Ye and Sister Qingwan

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:17.450
to be parted by this arranged marriage.

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:22.990
Even before that, that sly fox had
a hand in General Nan's death...

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:26.330
General Nan cared for me like a son.

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:28.500
I can never repay his kindness now.

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:31.890
He was murdered. He died without justice.

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:35.950
And I will make sure Qian
Aotian pays with his blood.

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:41.470
My exquisite white jade cup...

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:47.040
While we are on the subject, Brother Ye has
a date with Sister Qingwan today, correct?

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:48.720
Why has she not arrived yet?

00:06:51.570 --> 00:06:54.890
Nan Qingwan, eldest daughter 
of the late General Nan.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:58.850
A goddess to the capital's saps. Good-natured,
hugely popular, and the focus of daily gossip.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:00.720
FORTUNE

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:03.350
I will make a fortune
selling her personal items.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:14.700
<i>He caught it? Seems he 
isn't your average thief.</i>

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.470
Is that the best you can do?

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:21.100
Counterattack: Pan Throw!

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:21.100
Counter
attack:

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:21.100
Pan Throw!

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:22.850
Mistress Yunxi!

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:22.850
Watch out!

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:26.180
You're still too green!

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:29.350
Super Combo: Pan Reversal!

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:29.350
Super Combo: Pan Reversal!

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:31.850
Critical hit! Pan-fried!

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:31.850
Critical hit!

00:07:31.430 --> 00:07:31.850
Pan-fried!

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:45.520
Finishing Move: Pan Punch!

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:45.970
Finishing Move:

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:45.970
Pan Punch!

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:51.220
<i>People are fighting over there.</i>

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:58.220
If you apologize now, I might go easy on you.

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:04.970
<i>Damn, my face has swollen up like a ball.
How is that "going easy" on me?!</i>

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:11.930
Got nothing to say? Okay, tough guy!

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.120
How dare you ignore me!

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:18.970
Gonna say sorry?

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.120
If you don't, your suffering will continue!

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.720
<i><i>Somebody help me!</i></i>

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:29.350
<i><i>I know! My safety shirt!</i></i>

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:31.350
<i>Please</i>

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:34.970
<i>Please spare me!</i>

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:37.220
Huh? Don't tell me he bought that
from the anti-theft store too...

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:42.600
Get your safety shirt! Metal-proof, ready
to wear, and full refund if you die in it.

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:44.600
<i>Got you!</i>

00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:49.960
Mistress Yunxi, watch out!

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:53.600
Sesame!

00:08:57.440 --> 00:08:59.220
How dare you hurt my friend!

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:04.470
<i><i>Wh-What friend? There is
only the two of us here...</i></i>

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:09.140
I will show you what <i>real</i> poison is like!

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:17.350
That smoke...

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:20.220
Brother Ye!

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:33.860
Who are you?

00:09:33.370 --> 00:09:34.720
Another one showed up.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:37.540
Hold it.

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:41.810
I knew you two were in league.

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:43.970
I have a question I wish to ask you.

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:45.220
Let go of me!

00:09:54.560 --> 00:09:56.540
Where did you get that smoke bomb?

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:57.970
None of your business!

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:00.720
You...

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:01.740
What?

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:13.060
How dare you strike the face of the prince...

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:14.220
Speak!

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:18.270
Are you the assassin that attacked me
in my princely palace two nights ago?

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:19.390
Assassin?

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:21.660
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:10:22.560 --> 00:10:24.620
<i><i>He called himself the "prince"... Don't tell me...</i></i>

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:28.840
You refuse to answer?
Then, I will break your neck.

00:10:31.510 --> 00:10:33.200
Youming! My lord, stop!

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:41.640
This man is not at fault. 
He was helping me catch the thief.

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:42.950
Wan'er...

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:50.640
Wan'er, what happened?

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:52.660
Forgive me, Lord Youming.

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:56.020
I was on my way to meet you when
a pickpocket stole from me, making me late.

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:03.340
This is a new sight! A day when
Brother Ye does not win out.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:09.440
Qingwan, it has been a while. Are you well now?

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:14.750
Thank you for your concern, Lord Zimo.

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:17.270
Thanks to your medicine, I am much better.

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:19.660
Glad to hear it.

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:22.140
I will send you some more later.

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:25.610
After General Nan's death, it has been
difficult for you and your mother.

00:11:25.610 --> 00:11:27.390
Let me know if you need any help.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:30.750
Wan'er, you asked me to go with
you to Tan Yin Temple to pray.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.350
What is this about?

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:36.930
Nightmares have plagued my mother
recently, and she has no appetite.

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:39.150
She consulted the doctor but is no better.

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:41.410
I thought praying at Tan
Yin Temple might help.

00:11:42.560 --> 00:11:46.010
General Nan's death is the cause of 
Auntie's illness and inability to recover.

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:47.550
Worry not.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:52.810
I will dice Qian Aotian into a thousand
 pieces so that General Nan may find his rest.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.140
Youming...

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:59.130
All right, enough. Let us not speak of such 
unpleasant things in front of Qingwan.

00:11:59.720 --> 00:12:01.860
Let us go together to Tan Yin Temple.

00:12:02.350 --> 00:12:03.640
Little Po, will you join us?

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:07.200
Naturally. I am a bodyguard of the first order.

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:10.140
If any more thieves dare to 
offend Sister Qingwan, I will—

00:12:12.470 --> 00:12:13.640
Where <i>is</i> the thief?

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:28.390
What luck. Qingwan's purse is still here.

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:35.270
<i>That man... was actually Ye Youming!</i>

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:38.640
I see. The real thief slipped away long ago.

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:45.920
And the young man who fought Brother 
Ye was attempting to catch the thief.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.680
Qingwan, is anything missing?

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:54.140
Thank goodness. Father's jade pendant
is still here. Nothing is missing.

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:57.680
If I had been there, I would
never have let the thief escape.

00:12:58.140 --> 00:13:01.080
How do you feel knowing you hurt the
hero of the hour by mistake, Brother Ye?

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.310
The "hero"?

00:13:05.640 --> 00:13:08.830
I should've checked the calendar to see
if today was unlucky before I left.

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:13.490
Hey, twerp. Why didn't you help out just now?

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:17.930
I was feeling really weak...

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:22.270
You always feel weak when I need help,
but you're lively again when dinner's ready!

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:25.290
Mistress Yunxi, it is true!

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:29.910
When I was looking for food in the Ye Princely
 Palace, I felt my energy drain halfway,

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:31.830
and I only recovered the next day.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:32.680
The Ye Palace?

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:38.560
<i>Come to think of it, last time I ran into him,
Mochi seemed to pass out then too.</i>

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:42.310
Ah! Why do bad things happen 
every time Prince Ye-diot is around?!

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:43.640
That harbinger of bad luck!

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:47.580
Two days ago, an assassin used
the same psychedelic smoke on me.

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:49.110
Psychedelic smoke?

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:53.260
Anyone hit with it feels drained
and loses their ability to fight...

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:55.120
I remember now!

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:59.450
It is a weapon used by the Western Tribe.

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:00.680
Is Qian Aotian involved?

00:14:02.310 --> 00:14:03.300
Here are my orders!

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:06.600
Lock down the city
and flush out that man!

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:10.430
Even if it means digging three-meter holes
all over the city, he must be found.

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:14.060
Brother Ye.

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:20.130
What are you doing? You said you
would not act rashly and alert the enemy.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:22.560
He trifled with Qingwan.

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:27.030
He aided Qingwan in retrieving her purse.
It would seem he is not without virtue.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:30.390
Do you have any evidence that
he was the one who attacked you?

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:34.960
If you have no evidence, 
we must not be reckless,

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:37.180
or that sly old fox will bite us.

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:38.960
Brother Yu speaks sense.

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:45.770
Let us go to Tan Yin Temple.

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:48.910
I will overlook it this time.

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:51.400
<i><i>But General Nan, please find peace.</i></i>

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:56.770
<i><i>Those who have hurt Wan'er,
and all of Qian Aotian's relations...</i></i>

00:14:56.770 --> 00:14:58.220
<i><i>I, Ye Youming,</i></i>

00:14:58.890 --> 00:15:01.220
<i><i>pledge that none shall escape my wrath.</i></i>

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:07.680
That bad luck bringer! So annoying!

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:09.550
So what if you're Prince Ye?

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:12.030
I'll beat you up next time.

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:14.320
You say that, but you didn't 
even recognize your own husband.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:16.430
He didn't recognize me either.

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:19.680
You were veiled that night.
That'd even fool a ghost.

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:21.870
Are you picking a fight?

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:27.450
Mistress Yunxi, do not be angry.

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:28.670
Look over there.

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:30.720
Drunk
Fairy

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:30.720
Drunk
Fairy

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:31.140
Drunk
Fairy

00:15:30.720 --> 00:15:31.140
Drunk
Fairy

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:31.470
Drunk
Fairy

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:31.470
Drunk
Fairy

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:32.430
Drunk
Fairy

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:32.430
Drunk
Fairy

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:32.890
The "Drunk Fairy"?

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:35.040
Yes, this is the best 
restaurant in the capital,

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:36.660
serving only the finest food and drink.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:38.950
Mistress Yunxi must be hungry.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:41.150
Shall we have a meal here?

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:43.570
Watch out!

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:48.640
Ow, my hip!

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:54.910
Mr. Zhang, how many times must I tell you?

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:57.680
You must have charm or you must have money.

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:02.300
You have neither, so the Drunk
Fairy is not the place for you.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:09.660
This young man is most handsome.

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:13.910
I-I have spent 500 taels in here!

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:17.810
It said I could choose any combo once the
minimum spend was reached. What changed?

00:16:18.050 --> 00:16:22.680
Your spend was cumulative. 
The requirement is over 500 taels on <i>one</i> bill.

00:16:25.090 --> 00:16:27.780
I will tell everyone how
terrible this restaurant is!

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:33.660
Sorry about that, sir.

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:37.310
Please walk this way.
I will serve you some chicken.

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:38.390
Chicken?
